          "supports": "Sign in with Vercel tokens page: vca_ + 56 [A-Za-z0-9], checksum-valid (present 2025-11-28)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "field-alphabet-bound",
      "statement": "alphabet-bound: _ and - are not in the body (Bounded by the record (every provider example is alphanumeric); a body with _ or - is an alphabet twin.)",
      "evidenceClass": "provider-documented",
      "temporality": "current",
      "observedAt": "2026-09-29",
      "sources": [
        {
          "sourceId": "github-com-mongodb-kingfisher-81669063af",
          "supports": "admits _ and - in the first 50",
          "locator": "#L46-L299"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "github-com-vercel-vercel-azure-devops-extension-b513a9d723",
          "supports": "the masker admits _ and -, with no length",
          "locator": "#L37-L38"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "vercel-com-ee64691632",
          "supports": "alphabet-bound: _ and - are not in the body"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "field-checksum",
      "statement": "checksum: the last 6 characters may be base62 (0-9A-Za-z) of the CRC-32 of the 50 before them (Not enforced and never a twin: positives carry a matching and a mismatching tail.)",
      "evidenceClass": "unresolved",
      "temporality": "current",
      "observedAt": "2026-09-29",
      "sources": [
        {
          "sourceId": "openapi-vercel-sh-403403b630",
          "supports": "tokenSuffix: \"The token checksum suffix.\""
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "vercel-com-454aecdbd1",
          "supports": "the vcp_ example fails it"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "vercel-com-ee64691632",
          "supports": "the vca_ example passes it"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "field-sibling-classes",
      "statement": "sibling-classes: vci_ and vck_ are other Vercel classes, STILL-BLOCKED on the body (Q-VC); the legacy unprefixed 24-character token is excluded (Neither a positive nor a control.)",
      "evidenceClass": "provider-documented",
